WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:15.573
Ringo and Bot returned from a mission.

2
00:00:15.574 --> 00:00:21.075
Ringo yawned. "I need a nap!"

3
00:00:21.076 --> 00:00:29.056
"Get some rest," Bot said.

4
00:00:29.057 --> 00:00:39.035
Ringo got into bed.

5
00:00:39.036 --> 00:00:45.575
Lucy looked in the room.

6
00:00:45.576 --> 00:00:48.744
"Why are you in bed?" she asked.

7
00:00:48.745 --> 00:00:51.664
"It's the middle of the day!"

8
00:00:51.665 --> 00:00:57.631
Ringo yawned again. "I'm tired.

9
00:00:57.632 --> 00:00:59.453
I just got back from a—"

10
00:00:59.454 --> 00:01:03.307
"Get up!" Lucy kicked his bed.

11
00:01:03.308 --> 00:01:10.206
"I need a kickboxing partner!"

12
00:01:10.207 --> 00:01:15.443
Lucy and Ringo went to the gym.

13
00:01:15.444 --> 00:01:21.804
Ringo groaned. "I'm tired."

14
00:01:21.805 --> 00:01:25.047
Lucy handed him a big pad.

15
00:01:25.048 --> 00:01:28.734
"Hold this," she said.

16
00:01:28.735 --> 00:01:31.183
Ringo held the pad.

17
00:01:31.184 --> 00:01:36.474
Lucy kicked it—hard! Boomph!

18
00:01:36.475 --> 00:01:39.218
She hit it. Pow!

19
00:01:39.218 --> 00:01:43.970
"Oof! Ouch!" Ringo said.

20
00:01:43.971 --> 00:01:47.728
"Be tough, Ringo!" Lucy said.

21
00:01:47.729 --> 00:01:50.455
Boomph! Pow!

22
00:01:50.456 --> 00:01:53.816
Ringo slid backward.

23
00:01:53.817 --> 00:01:57.776
"Stop moving!" Lucy said.

24
00:01:57.777 --> 00:02:00.839
"I can't!" Ringo said.

25
00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:04.163
"You're too strong!"

26
00:02:04.164 --> 00:02:07.756
Captain Nova's voice came over a speaker.

27
00:02:07.757 --> 00:02:18.887
"Ringo!" she said. "Come to my office!"

28
00:02:18.888 --> 00:02:21.181
"Whew," Ringo said.

29
00:02:21.182 --> 00:02:27.795
"I hope it's not another mission!" He sighed.

30
00:02:27.796 --> 00:02:38.652
"I'm so tired!"

31
00:02:38.653 --> 00:02:47.216
Ringo went to Captain Nova's office.

32
00:02:47.217 --> 00:02:51.696
The captain smiled. "You work hard, Ringo.

33
00:02:51.697 --> 00:03:04.691
So you're going on vacation!"

